### 로그인 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dev1@dandi.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 회원가입 API
# 이메일 인증 확인 API 응답의 emailVerifiedToken을 env에 복사한 뒤 실행
POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailVerifiedToken": "{{emailVerifiedToken}}",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "nickname": "진우 집사",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "birth": "1998-03-12",
  "height": 175,
  "weight": 80
}

### 이메일 인증 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/email-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "example@naver.com"
}

### 이메일 인증 확인 API
# 발송 API 응답의 emailChallengeToken을 env에 복사한 뒤 실행
POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/email-verification/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authCode": "123456",
  "emailChallengeToken": "{{emailChallengeToken}}"
}

### access token 재발급 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 로그아웃 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}